        (
            name: "create-campaign",
            aliases: [],
            description: Some("Creates an orchestration of data collection rules. The Amazon Web Services IoT FleetWise Edge Agent software running in vehicles uses campaigns to decide how to collect and transfer data to the cloud. You create campaigns in the cloud. After you or your team approve campaigns, Amazon Web Services IoT FleetWise automatically deploys them to vehicles.  For more information, see Collect and transfer data with campaigns in the Amazon Web Services IoT FleetWise Developer Guide.  Access to certain Amazon Web Services IoT FleetWise features is currently gated. For more information, see Amazon Web Services Region and feature availability in the Amazon Web Services IoT FleetWise Developer Guide"),
